                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "069e1a0d-4599-35df-a764-c3b4fb17f33b",
                        "entry_id": "95048502-d8e0-3239-9fb8-d1af1ced1a58",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. учёный, специалист в области орнитологии; тот, кто изучает птиц"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98f5a121-743f-439c-8bb0-bb0f07f7d500",
                                "sense_id": "069e1a0d-4599-35df-a764-c3b4fb17f33b",
                                "text": "Орнитологам это помогает выяснить маршруты миграций птиц и ещё многие другие полезные вещи."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30edbd6b-cce9-4873-b72d-f045be9be7d3",
                                "sense_id": "069e1a0d-4599-35df-a764-c3b4fb17f33b",
                                "text": "Орнитологи однозначно утверждают: воробей дрессировке и приручению не поддаётся."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bf190c98-c0a8-4225-bc9f-d921cd5902bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "95048502-d8e0-3239-9fb8-d1af1ced1a58",
                        "source_sense_id": "069e1a0d-4599-35df-a764-c3b4fb17f33b",
                        "target_lang_word": "ornithologist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ornithologist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c24bc0c-d5fa-32b4-aabf-97ae84cae3c6",
                                        "entry_id": "7fe72f1e-3c82-3614-9d0c-a952505912c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who studies or practices ornithology."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2744c2e-7891-4d75-adda-fd45c952f655",
                                                "sense_id": "8c24bc0c-d5fa-32b4-aabf-97ae84cae3c6",
                                                "text": "Mr. Worple in his spare time was what is known as an ornithologist. He had written a book called American Birds, and was writing another, to be called More American Birds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7840cd92-ee57-4029-b369-f2bd6c312168",
                                                "sense_id": "8c24bc0c-d5fa-32b4-aabf-97ae84cae3c6",
                                                "text": "Many of these classic methods are still used, with some modern improvements. For example, with the aid of special microphones and automated sound detection software, ornithologists recently reported […] that pine siskins (Spinus pinus) undergo an irregular, nomadic type of nocturnal migration."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
